    "body": "Make both Stage 7 `pay` preparations produce one visible, persisted tactical payoff inside the first real argument battle.\n\n- `Потребовать расписку` automatically marks the visible canonical defense whose normalized family matches Райхан's incoming attack\n- `Оставить всё как есть` exposes one exactly-once `Разобрать давление` action that marks one visible wrong-family defense as Олег's pressure line\n- both paths persist the full safe three-defense snapshot, restore the exact set after refresh and keep restored choices selectable through `battle._defenseChoices`\n- pending unused pressure analysis expires when the bridge battle finishes\n- both effects require the stable Stage 7 bridge ID and exact bridge battle ID\n- ordinary battles, argument canon, conflict core/API/economy/data/system and settlement remain unchanged\n- source/docs mirrors and cache markers stay synchronized\n\nValidation:\n- final implementation workflow `31064685194` PASS\n- focused dynamic receipt/pressure/refresh/expiry/ordinary-battle harness PASS\n- current superseding Stage 7.7-7.11 regression matrix PASS\n- first causal vertical slice and observed evidence harness PASS\n- source/docs parity, Node syntax and `git diff --check`\n- exact final twelve-file scope against `main`\n- no protected mechanics mutation and no network transmission\n\nHistorical note: an initial broad glob run reached the Stage 7.6 test, which intentionally asserts the superseded Stage 7.6 cache marker. The current superseding onboarding matrix passed without modifying that historical contract.",
